<BaseLayout title="Lobo — Retopología 3D">
  <h1>Wolf 3D Character</h1>

  <p>
This project showcases the full 3D character creation pipeline, from initial sculpt
to a production-ready asset. The wolf character was developed entirely in Blender,
covering sculpting, retopology, and rig preparation with a strong focus on clean topology
and animation-ready structure.
</p>

 <p>
Special attention was given to edge flow in deformation areas such as the face, neck,
and limbs, ensuring proper articulation and flexibility for animation. The final mesh
is optimized for rigging while maintaining the original sculpt’s form and details.
</p>

<ul class="details">
  <li><strong>Type:</strong> 3D Character Project</li>
  <li><strong>Workflow:</strong> Sculpting · Retopology · Rig Preparation</li>
  <li><strong>Software:</strong> Blender</li>
  <li><strong>Year:</strong> 2025</li>
</ul>

